        "content": "# Heinlein Support GmbH \u2014 OpenCloud\n\n## Lead record\n- **company**: Heinlein Support GmbH\n- **tool**: OpenCloud\n- **priority**: 3 \u00b7 later\n- **geo**: DE Berlin\n- **principal**: \u2014\n- **email**: \u2014\n- **website**: https://heinlein-support.de\n- **tool_url**: https://opencloud.eu/\n- **impressum_url**: \u2014\n- **contact_verified**: No\n- **headcount**: \u2014\n- **hq**: \u2014\n- **owner_parent**: \u2014\n- **tech_partners**: \u2014\n- **federation**: \u2014\n- **posture**: \u2014\n- **tier**: \u2014\n- **verdict**: \u2014\n- **flag**: \u2014\n- **source**: \u2014\n- **powerhouse_fit**: OpenCloud is the newer German sovereign file platform \u2014 same shape as Nextcloud: file events, no business decisions. Heinlein backs it, so this is early enough to be co-designed rather than bolted on.\n- **demo_scenario**: OpenCloud webhook dispatching a typed operation on document state change, proposed as a joint reference with Heinlein while the platform is still young.",
